        "Description": "Five women. One face. Five names on the contract.\n\nBeneath the scorching Moroccan sun, the crowded markets conceal a disturbing coincidence. Different lives, different disguises — yet the same face stares back.\n\n\rCoincidence is a luxury in your profession, 47.\n\n\rFind all five. Leave no witnesses to the resemblance.\n\nGood hunting.",
